{"id":"8f3eed13-567f-45aa-9c4c-cd8acc0c49f1","revision":0,"last_node_id":16,"last_link_id":22,"nodes":[{"id":16,"type":"Note","pos":[61.30891736998927,20],"size":[1560,300],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"说明 · 夜市百相簿（闻灯 · 白底全身设定图）v2","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["角色：闻灯 · 24 岁男性 · 半妖借形人 / 旧市夜巡所临时书记　【底模 majicmixRealistic_v7（SD 1.5）】\n\n【v2 修了什么】上一版出的是「白发女性特写 + 磨皮 + 不是全身」，五个原因逐个修：\n  1. 种子在乱跳 → 两个 KSampler 的 control_after_generate 全部锁成 fixed，seed=20260916（这是之前唯一出对男性的种子）\n  2. 全白高调光把主体漂白（白发、惨白皮肤）→ B 段改成「白底 + 侧光/硬光/轮廓光」，用有方向的光把黑发和皮肤结构压住\n  3. 没有男性五官锚点 → A 段补 masculine face / masculine jawline / bare face，B 段再复述一次 1boy（合并后「1boy」出现两次 = 双倍权重）\n  4. 一个皮肤质感词都没有 → B 段补 realistic skin texture / skin pores / skin details / peach fuzz；负向补 airbrushed / beauty filter\n  5. 构图锚点太弱 → 开头就是 full body shot, head to toe，结尾再补 full length；负向新增 close-up / portrait / headshot / bust shot / cropped 反向压制特写\n\n【为什么正向词要拆成两段】\nSD 1.5 的 CLIP 一次只吃 75 个 token，超出部分会被静默丢弃。原设定逐字直译是 185 token，从「旧风衣」往后全被扔了。\n拆成两段编码再用 ConditioningCombine 合并，等于把容量扩到约 150 token：\n    A 段 = 人物长什么样 + 构图　　71 token\n    B 段 = 白底 + 光位 + 皮肤质感　55 token\n两段各自都不超 75，改哪一段都不会把另一段挤掉。\n\n【尺寸】512×768 → 高清修复 768×1152。第二段 denoise 固定 0.45，别调高，0.7 以上画面会崩。\n【预览】结尾 PreviewImage 直接显示在界面上，SaveImage 才落盘。\n⚠ 本机纯 CPU 约 25 分钟一张。\n⚠ 底模是女性向的，男性形象靠提示词硬掰。想彻底解决要换男性向的 SD 1.5 写实底模。"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":2,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[571.3089173699892,380],"size":[560,300],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":1},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[5]}],"title":"正向 A · 人物与构图（71 token）","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.1","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["full body shot, head to toe, 1boy, solo, 24 year old man, east asian, masculine face, masculine jawline, bare face, slim lean build, short black wavy hair, tired eyes, small mole at outer eye corner, blue old shirt, dark trench coat open, old ledger, worn old shoes, standing, full length"]},{"id":3,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[571.3089173699892,730],"size":[560,260],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":2},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[6]}],"title":"正向 B · 白底 + 光位 + 皮肤质感（55 token）","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.1","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["white background, light grey seamless backdrop, side lighting, directional light, strong rim light, hard light, 1boy, detailed skin texture, skin pores, fine skin details, peach fuzz, black hair, sharp focus, film grain, 35mm lens, photorealistic"]},{"id":4,"type":"ConditioningCombine","pos":[1191.3089173699893,380],"size":[330,90],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"条件_1","name":"conditioning_1","type":"CONDITIONING","link":5},{"localized_name":"条件_2","name":"conditioning_2","type":"CONDITIONING","link":6}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[7,17]}],"title":"合并 A + B（突破 75 token 上限的关键）","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.1","Node name for S&R":"ConditioningCombine"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":5,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[571.3089173699892,1040],"size":[560,280],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":3},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[8,18]}],"title":"负向（71 token，已删掉会造成脸崩的脸部词）","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.1","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEnco